        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also developed relationships that expand brand exposure and introduce new customers to our services, including programs that provide vehicles to ride-hail drivers in cities across North America.",
        "start_character": 12393,
        "end_character": 12595
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723612-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we have implemented policies and procedures to promptly address manufacturer recalls as part of our ongoing maintenance and repair efforts to maximize the customer experience.",
        "start_character": 24054,
        "end_character": 24242
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723612-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate the Payless and Apex brands in the value segment.",
        "start_character": 3899,
        "end_character": 3972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723612-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To accomplish this task, we have developed and continue to evolve specialized training programs for our technicians as well as cooperate with specialized vendors and expert repair networks.",
        "start_character": 23574,
        "end_character": 23763
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723612-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leading global provider of mobility solutions through our three most recognized brands, Avis, Budget and Zipcar, as well as several other brands, well recognized in their respective markets.",
        "start_character": 361,
        "end_character": 560
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723612-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723612-26-000012-b8ddc4042d33a1f7",
        "accession_number": "0000723612-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We generally maintain a leading share of airport car rental revenues in North America, Europe and Australasia, and we operate a leading car sharing network and one of the leading commercial truck rental businesses in the United States.",
